# VoxPilot Environment Configuration
#
# Client-side configuration (Vite exposed variables)
# Notice: Never place sensitive private API secrets in VITE_* variables.
# All VITE_* variables are embedded in the client build and accessible to browser JavaScript.

# Backend API Base URL
# Development default uses Vite proxy: /api
# In production, specify the full URL of the voice backend or keep relative if using a reverse proxy.
VITE_API_URL=/api
